      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm writing an article for my tech column about how AI is gonna wreck the job market in the next few years. i want to focus on the inevitability of Universal Basic Income. can you outline the most convincing arguments for why UBI is the only viable solution to the coming job crisis? thanks thanks. turn weight it heavily towards the why it makes has to happen.mountains..mountains",
